{"id":"vod_zy360_67157","vodId":"67157","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"家庭教师","name_cn":"家庭教师","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全203集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241029-1/7b8d6bc065792b1d4bdf95a8b4fd0c1e.jpg"},"summary":"长得像婴儿一样可爱的里包恩（西萩五十铃配音），真实身份其实是令人闻风丧胆的意大利黑手党杀手。他奉彭格列的第九代老大的命令，来到日本寻找彭格列的第十代老大沢田纲吉（国分优香里配音），并把他培养成合格的接班人。沢田纲吉外号废柴纲，就读于并盛中学一年A班，全科成绩平均17.5分，跳马只能跳三层，单杠向上翻转也不会，无论做什么事都不行的废柴。里包恩行为搞怪过激，让一向邋遢不求上进的纲头疼不已。但是里包恩通过必死弹，竟然让并盛中学的偶像笹川京子（稲村优奈配音）对一直默默无闻的纲产生了好感。纲慢慢开始接受里包恩的改造，过起了欢乐和恐怖的生活，并向黑手党首领一步步迈进。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-29 16:19:38","classic":true,"classicRank":48,"franchise":"家庭教师","playable":true,"episodeCount":406,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第001话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/m95Xsoa1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第002话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/Vv9BFCS3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第003话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/NwvgpQaj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第004话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/cprpkvvz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第005话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/FlOxvrla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第006话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/H7Xljt0r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第007话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/mLDnb8oW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第008话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/182dPn1X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第009话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/ngLeRd02/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第010话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/BPRJSiXA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第011话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/5gNkgicE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第012话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/7hPmaSTI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第013话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/ojDUUM1c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第014话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241027/leDkygsd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第015话",